and practice a few coding exercises to sharpen up before test day.\n              </p>\n\n              <!-- Button -->\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 auto 10px;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" style=\"border-radius:8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #22c55e); box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(59,130,246,0.5);\">\n                    <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/JHG323456VGCHFtyfgnvc\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:16px 40px; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:8px;\">\n                      🚀 Go to Course Group\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:25px 30px 35px; text-align:center;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;\">Stay focused, {{$json.name}} — you've got this. 💪</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#4b5563;\">© 2026 Fizz Academy. All rights reserved.</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
